      "created_at": "2023-03-14T22:34:59.847Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don’t have a lot to say about the plot of the episode (other than the obvious fact that Spite fighting a hell’s-worth of demons sounds EXTREMELY metal), but as far as the goth merch question:<br>\nThose little heart necklaces where you and your BFF each wear one half of the heart, except the heart is made up of two black wings. Romantic and sappy and gothic all at once!</p>",
