      "created_at": "2023-03-15T01:42:51.888Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This was a fun episode! I wish we got more of a play-by-play of the actual fight, but the conclusion is still pretty cool: Rambler using other-worldly entities as human shields that still fail to stand up to Spite is amazing.</p>\n<p>I wonder what the mind/entity of Aeternus thinks of this event. I would love to see some art of a hypothetical Spite: Agent of Torment, even if the story would never happen.</p>",
