      "cooked": "<p>Still no picture of Rambler in this cover.  But I dig it, it’s very very Spawn McFarlane.  (And I do know what RJ looks like because of my accidentally posting in episode 293 I think.)</p>\n<p>Okay, so this is the first confirmation that the seven Aeturnus lords we know are Deadly Sins.  I’m a little sad and a little happy about this, as it’s very formulaic and overdone, but also a classic for good reason.  But I think this is the most info we’ve ever gotten, so it makes me want to do a listicle.<br>\nMannok - Greed<br>\nLucithar - Pride (how fitting that he accidentally makes Busybody)<br>\nBellagor - Sloth<br>\nAvornus (that’s not the name, I missed it) - Wrath<br>\nGrizzigrax - Lust?<br>\nSoviathal (which I earlier mistyped as Soulviathan) - Envy<br>\n??? - Gluttony</p>",
